{"id":"n83468-1-7","stage":4,"title":"승 · 胜","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83468-1-7-1","ko":"오늘 농구 경기 말이야. 우리가 이겼어?","zh":"今天那场篮球赛啊，我们赢了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"농구","meaning":"篮球","explanation":"농구：篮球","readings":[{"term":"농구","audio":"/audio/ee488a636544e5f46302.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28323","senseId":"1","lemma":"농구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"농구","audio":"/audio/ee488a636544e5f46302.mp3"}},{"text":"경기","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}},{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"이겼어?","meaning":"赢，战胜，打败","explanation":"이기다：赢，战胜，打败；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"이기다","audio":"/audio/f623afa3b5ca8273fc1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71688","senseId":"1","lemma":"이기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이겼어","audio":"/audio/eca40cc6bb69f2e35374.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"ee488a636544e5f4","term":"농구","zh":"篮球","audio":"/audio/ee488a636544e5f46302.mp3","entryId":"28323","definition":"两支五人队伍之间进行的比赛，在对方的篮筐中投球更多的队伍获胜。","pronunciation":["농구"]},{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"60094","definition":"互相比较运动或技术等的能力。","pronunciation":["경ː기"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"f623afa3b5ca8273","term":"이기다","zh":"赢，战胜，打败","audio":"/audio/f623afa3b5ca8273fc1e.mp3","entryId":"71688","definition":"在打赌、竞赛或战争等中压制对手，创造佳绩。","pronunciation":["이기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/06770b35d1173cce4757.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83468-1-7-2","ko":"응, 이번에 또 1승 추가했어.","zh":"嗯，这次又多赢了一场。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text"